      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The first half of a deployment: train a small iris classifier (4 measurements in, 3 species out) and export its weights. Test accuracy is 1.000. ModelSaver writes iris-classifier.safetensors into the models directory, in safetensors format, which holds tensors only and cannot run code when loaded. Then open Serve-As-Function from the same gallery folder: it loads this file and answers one flower at a time over HTTP.\n\n部署的前半段：訓練一個小的 iris 分類器（輸入 4 個測量值，輸出 3 個品種），並匯出權重。測試正確率是 1.000。ModelSaver 把 iris-classifier.safetensors 寫到 models 目錄，格式是 safetensors：只存張量，載入時不會執行任何程式碼。接著打開同一個資料夾裡的 Serve-As-Function：它載入這個檔案，透過 HTTP 一次回答一朵花。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-contract",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2160,
        "y": -239
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The serving graph rebuilds the model from its layer list and loads only the weights, so both graphs must use the same layers (here 4, 16, 3). Change one, change the other.\n\n負責服務的圖依照層的清單重建模型，只載入權重，所以兩張圖的層必須相同（這裡是 4、16、3）。改了一邊，另一邊也要改。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "save",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -239
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    }
